# Stage 4 Hackl (D-056, game-design.md "New mechanics"): the solver route
# to the church plateau (it runs under the H-box), then Resi stops, walks
# back under the H-box (164, row 8, 2 rows above the plateau), bumps it,
# and the Hackl rises onto it and stays; a straight jump beside the box with
# a drift left takes it (Normal -> Hackl, „Wirf, Resi, wirf!" + 1000) and
# she lands on the box. Facing right from the box top she throws an axe
# every 31 frames (new RUN presses): the first takes the Wolfgang pigeon off
# the statue, later ones defeat pilger group C (3 x 100, outside the stomp
# chain) on the saddle's clear axe lane. No hurt.
level  = falkenstein
